     "<div dir=\"ltr\">Please respond to Berkay if you are interested! <b>(<a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">berk...@gmail.com</a>)</b><div><br></div><div><div><i>I&#39;m taking a &quot;biostatistics in bioinformatics&quot; class, it was much higher level than I expected and I am having trouble returning my final report. As a final report I need to find or simulate a gene expression dataset and analyze it for statistically significant genes. Currently I am able to import a dataset from GEO database (accession: GSE173360) and I am able to preprocess it. My statistical knowledge is weak which is the reason I took the class but class assumed basic statistics knowledge.</i></div><div><i><br></i></div><div><i>Currently I&#39;m looking for a tutor to help me finalize my report. I am willing to compensate for their effort and time. Requirements are very flexible. I can analyze any data set or simulate a gene expression dataset and analyze it pretty much any way I prefer. I&#39;m also attaching my RScript so if someone would be interested can take a look at it and see where I am at now.</i></div><div><i><br></i></div><div><i>Thanks a lot in advance for your help, I really appreciate it!</i></div><div><i><br></i></div><div><div style=\"font-size:0.875rem;direction:ltr;margin:8px 0px 0px;padding:0px;font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><div style=\"overflow:hidden;font-variant-numeric:normal;font-variant-east-asian:normal;font-stretch:normal;font-size:small;line-height:1.5;font-family:Arial,Helvetica,sans-serif\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"font-size:12.8px\"><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">Higgins Fellow</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">University of Memphis - Earth Sciences</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">University of Maine - Intermedia MFA</font></div><div style=\"font-size:small\"><font face=\"trebuchet ms, sans-serif\" size=\"1\">Istanbul Technical University MIAM</font></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div></div></div></div><div style=\"margin:15px 0px;clear:both;font-size:0.875rem;font-family:Roboto,RobotoDraft,Helvetica,Arial,sans-serif\"><br></div></div>-- <br><div dir=\"ltr\" class=\"gmail_signature\" data-smartmail=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;background-color:rgb(255,255,255)\"><br><span style=\"line-height:19px\"><font face=\"times new roman, serif\"><i><b><span style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px;float:none;background-color:rgb(255,255,255);display:inline\"><span> </span></span><br style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-size:small;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align:start;text-indent:0px;text-transform:none;white-space:normal;word-spacing:0px\"></b></i></font></span><div style=\"color:rgb(34,34,34);font-family:arial,sans-serif;font-style:normal;font-variant:normal;font-weight:normal;letter-spacing:normal;line-height:normal;text-align